#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:6
msgid "# SAP Security"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:8
msgid ""
"Current SAP deployment assumes a **trusted local machine**. There is no "
"application-layer authentication on the WebSocket."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:10
msgid "## Trust boundary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph trusted [Trusted local host assumption]\n"
"    Hub[\"Hub anima service :2658\"]\n"
"    SapEndpoint[\"/sap/v1 WebSocket\"]\n"
"    SatA[Satellite pair-programming]\n"
"    SatB[Satellite parlor]\n"
"    Other[Any local process]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser[Browser loopback]\n"
"  Browser --> SatA\n"
"  Browser --> SatB\n"
"  SatA --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  SatB --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  Other -.->|\"no auth today\"| SapEndpoint\n"
"  SapEndpoint --> Hub\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:30
msgid "## Current controls"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Control | Status |\n"
"| ------- | ------ |\n"
"| TLS on SAP | Not required; typical bind is loopback |\n"
"| Token / API key on connect | **None** |\n"
"| Origin check on WebSocket | **None** |\n"
"| Session-scoped tool routing | **Yes** — [strict routing](tools.md) |\n"
"| Credential values in SAP frames | **No** — credentials stay in pass; LLM sees paths only |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:40
msgid ""
"Any process on the host that can reach `ws://127.0.0.1:2658/sap/v1` can:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Register tools as any `app_id` / `instance_id`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Create sessions and send messages through the Hub runtime"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Receive `tool.call` events for registered tools"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:46
msgid ""
"Operational guidance: bind Hub to loopback; do not expose port 2658 to "
"untrusted networks without additional controls. See [security guide](../"
"guide/security.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:48
msgid "## Protocol hardening (transport layer)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:50
msgid ""
"Invalid frames close the socket with **1003**. Protocol violations (double "
"connect, RPC before handshake) close with **1008**. These are integrity "
"checks, not authentication."
msgstr ""

